OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 900 people 'oppose'
OL,4,Areactor clean-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to clean up coolant from a
OL,7,FJapanese nuclear reactor have been
OL,8,Fopposed by more than 900 people, a
OL,9,Fcampaigning group has said.
OL,11,FCavendish Nuclear and Amentum want to
OL,12,Fbuild a facility at the Port of
OL,13,FWorkington, Cumbria, to support the
OL,14,Fdecommissioning of the
OL,15,FMonjub@/Prototype Fast Breeder Reactor
OL,16,F(FBR), in Fukui Prefecture, Japan.
OL,18,FMarianne Birkby, of Radiation Free
OL,19,FLakeland, said the scheme was
OL,20,F"dangerous" and its online petition,
OL,21,Fcalling for the waste to stay in Japan,
OL,22,Fhad been signed by hundreds of people.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
