OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 900 people 'oppose'
OL,4,Areactor clean-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlkali Metal Processing (AMP), the
OL,7,Fcompany behind the project, said it
OL,8,Fwanted the work to take place in the
OL,9,Fcounty because of its specialist
OL,10,Fexpertise.
